//si.imgix.net/91329199/uploads/origins/ba29991a-f23a-418b-a70a-923c9fa6b343?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e751b2b964b4c9cd421f7d225a889f51 2x, https://si.imgix.net/91329199/uploads/origins/ba29991a-f23a-418b-a70a-923c9fa6b343?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cbd45cb7e9083514d7b647492002decd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Tofu Sensei, I saw some of your Fire Emblem Artwork and was wondering if you could do me a piece of my favorite character Camilla, reference:  https://imgur.com/o6EtoOR  . I was wondering if you could make a piece of her in a costume like this, reference:  https://imgur.com/AryzPx5  , but just the red parts of the outfit to purple. I will leave the pose and facial expression up to you.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c5452ebb/uploads/origins/0199165f-1dca-439a-a73e-ad4e13cd3c4b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=145a5a08439484b254536abf2b7ec7e7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c5452ebb/uploads/origins/0199165f-1dca-439a-a73e-ad4e13cd3c4b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=145a5a08439484b254536abf2b7ec7e7, https://si.imgix.net/c5452ebb/uploads/origins/0199165f-1dca-439a-a73e-ad4e13cd3c4b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=148b932d3909123c32ea17e29e950912 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c5452ebb/uploads/origins/0199165f-1dca-439a-a73e-ad4e13cd3c4b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=353647e2369086f6f58dfaa1ed81b372 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you. I’m requesting an illustration of Princess Maria from Fire Emblem at a flower field during the day happy and adorable.\nhttps://i.imgur.com/HsZKJet.jpg\n\nI’ll leave the pose to you.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ba367d42/uploads/origins/b3c1ade6-db08-4998-abe9-bac5532fd235?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f91168548e9e521d6eb1ddde79a7013", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ba367d42/uploads/origins/b3c1ade6-db08-4998-abe9-bac5532fd235?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f91168548e9e521d6eb1ddde79a7013, https://si.imgix.net/ba367d42/uploads/origins/b3c1ade6-db08-4998-abe9-bac5532fd235?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61e29c8193d9a8e7b8a1555c1e70f64f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ba367d42/uploads/origins/b3c1ade6-db08-4998-abe9-bac5532fd235?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22379cb30833c249349d76628bfbef9f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I'd like to request a romantic scene between Princess Veronica (ヴェロニカ) and Prince Marks (マークス) from the Fire Emblem series. Below are the character design references:\n\nVeronica:\nhttps://guide.fire-emblem-heroes.com/00001005000881-2/\n(The wings are not part of Veronica's body; they are a part of the dress she wears)\n\nMarks:\nhttps://guide.fire-emblem-heroes.com/11005002000027-2/\n\nVeronica is around 155 cm tall, while Marks is around 190 cm tall.\n\nIn the crossover title Fire Emblem Heroes (FEH), Marks becomes a close ally to Veronica, and acts as her mentor and a \"big brother\" figure. In the scenario from the requested illustration, Veronica is seducing Marks, who gives in to Veronica's charm.\n\nVeronica must be wearing a maid outfit from Marks' kingdom, instead of her usual outfit. Here's some references for the outfit that Veronica must wear:\nhttps://guide.fire-emblem-heroes.com/11007001000290-2/\nhttps://www.reddit.com/r/fireemblem/comments/d4sqpj/i_drew_generic_maid/\n\nIn FEH, the two characters live in Veronica's palace. The setting of the illustration should be inspired on this image of said palace:\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/hnc6kc.webp\n\nMarks must be sitting in a couch, while Veronica is on top of Marks. Veronica must assertively get close to Marks, while the two look passionately at each other, as if they were about to kiss. Here's an example similar to the described scenario:\nhttps://twitter.com/_REIJI03/status/1512713174297972736\n\nFeel free to adjust the poses however you see fit. However, please use a perspective from which the high-heeled boots and the back of Veronica's maid outfit are visible. Veronica's and Marks' passionate and loving gazes should still be visible, please.\n\nFinally, if possible, I'd like to request an extra version that adds a few small inset panels showing the two characters lovingly kissing. These additional panels should focus only on the characters' mouths as they passionately kiss each other.\n\nThanks for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/be2c198f/uploads/origins/12190409-50b9-469e-a67b-2e4d1e76541a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68315720ebb1e91d077b1ea516981682", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/be2c198f/uploads/origins/12190409-50b9-469e-a67b-2e4d1e76541a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68315720ebb1e91d077b1ea516981682, https://si.imgix.net/be2c198f/uploads/origins/12190409-50b9-469e-a67b-2e4d1e76541a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=785b6d0d4209e995907362f12ccfdb99 2x, https://si.imgix.net/be2c198f/uploads/origins/12190409-50b9-469e-a67b-2e4d1e76541a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=77a94c6dd0cfeeead11b9ea013357b02 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Tofu!\n\nThank you for my previous Kagero request from Fire Emblem Fates. I would like to request another illustration.\n\nI was wondering if you could draw Kagero wearing Naramaya's Christmas outfit. She is looking at you with a gentle smile. Teacher can choose how she poses and background. Thank you very much!\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Sa_s_sa_/works/54\n\nhttps://gbf.wiki/Narmaya_(Holiday)#Base_Art", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a6e15d1c/uploads/origins/79d53641-88fc-4856-977d-818c09a38390?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7f6e935f67557a7f806bd825223cd836", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a6e15d1c/uploads/origins/79d53641-88fc-4856-977d-818c09a38390?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7f6e935f67557a7f806bd825223cd836, https://si.imgix.net/a6e15d1c/uploads/origins/79d53641-88fc-4856-977d-818c09a38390?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0f65767c56e1a42fdcad3ad3808aa6bd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a6e15d1c/uploads/origins/79d53641-88fc-4856-977d-818c09a38390?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bafc21b1fe6448998b1661e3d61363d4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c294259d/uploads/origins/9f62ce10-6f23-4283-9c5b-af39f8c1b496?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36e5bb2fe5bc9550fe1cee9d6d5e54de", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c294259d/uploads/origins/9f62ce10-6f23-4283-9c5b-af39f8c1b496?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36e5bb2fe5bc9550fe1cee9d6d5e54de, https://si.imgix.net/c294259d/uploads/origins/9f62ce10-6f23-4283-9c5b-af39f8c1b496?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=175deec3c688a655cbdf2fc86d2f5f67 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c294259d/uploads/origins/9f62ce10-6f23-4283-9c5b-af39f8c1b496?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97af334cdbad3aff71fca9cf69c2cacd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello,\n\nI would like to request a piece from you! I have attached a drive with two characters. They are friends and are riding a roller coaster together. The Grey Fox boy is nervous and the purple cat girl is mildly concerned for the grey fox boy. I would like the image to give off a cute feel. \n\nFeel free to decline if the request is unclear. Thank you for reading this far.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_JkXWTNJnQR58SHjJewamu4NJ2yQBHx1?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8faa32bd/uploads/origins/543bdb75-119d-4243-8050-ca8cfe1feef8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1acc68a616ce56826a8d88a676802843", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8faa32bd/uploads/origins/543bdb75-119d-4243-8050-ca8cfe1feef8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1acc68a616ce56826a8d88a676802843, https://si.imgix.net/8faa32bd/uploads/origins/543bdb75-119d-4243-8050-ca8cfe1feef8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09fb4d18218bd306398eca5d2638b8f5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8faa32bd/uploads/origins/543bdb75-119d-4243-8050-ca8cfe1feef8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5e199a79a691193c4f4e73bac183ec1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I'd like to request a drawing with Nah, Cherche and Oboro together in a relaxed situation. Mood should be lighthearted. Feel free to choose the pose composition. I'd prefer if the characters all had their eyes opened and mouths closed. Thanks in advance.\nhttps://imgur.com/a/hpbJVgd\nhttps://fireemblemwiki.org/w/images/f/fb/FEF_Oboro_01.png\nhttps://fireemblemwiki.org/w/images/b/b5/FEH_Cherche_Wyvern_Friend_01.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0d0b7771/uploads/origins/ef0f31ae-5a13-4ea1-a2c3-1e8994cb38e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=62bfd47bb9ce772c602a8dafadf2a95f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0d0b7771/uploads/origins/ef0f31ae-5a13-4ea1-a2c3-1e8994cb38e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=62bfd47bb9ce772c602a8dafadf2a95f, https://si.imgix.net/0d0b7771/uploads/origins/ef0f31ae-5a13-4ea1-a2c3-1e8994cb38e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5104128006fa452d4c36dd517b399ea3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0d0b7771/uploads/origins/ef0f31ae-5a13-4ea1-a2c3-1e8994cb38e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e6d5bc0a85032f65380c66593a38574 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I would like to request of Seliph and female Byleth on a sunny day, walking together while holding hands. Seliph is embarrassed, looking away and blushing, he's not used to public affection. Byleth is looking at him and giving him a warm smile, that everything will be alright. I prefer their Brave Outfits from FE Heroes, but their normal outfits are good too.\n\nThank you so much for your time and patience!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/n2R1shk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fe6a021e/uploads/origins/d7b1f838-e27a-43c4-a954-cd184482c6c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfb9eea8ed0df5d9d20ce58496133429", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fe6a021e/uploads/origins/d7b1f838-e27a-43c4-a954-cd184482c6c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfb9eea8ed0df5d9d20ce58496133429, https://si.imgix.net/fe6a021e/uploads/origins/d7b1f838-e27a-43c4-a954-cd184482c6c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d4038cabe3ed6e2880f162f64ef72b5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fe6a021e/uploads/origins/d7b1f838-e27a-43c4-a954-cd184482c6c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff1545492fdba9787e13eb19263bec99 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I would like to request art of Tana (ターナ) from Fire Emblem: The Sacred Stones. Here is official art of Tana for reference: https://imgur.com/a/c1dMtnY\n\n1. I would like Tana wearing this outfit from Fire Emblem Heroes: https://guide.fire-emblem-heroes.com/07002002000928-2/\n\n2. I would like the background to include the sky with the sun shining.\n\n3. Please feel free to choose the pose, expression, and any other details you feel comfortable with.\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/c1dMtnY", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9fc75fa7/uploads/origins/b259d2d8-1cdd-4253-ad0d-dafb962e567e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=98f4ccbff1e479b28d90d8989a7dba4c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9fc75fa7/uploads/origins/b259d2d8-1cdd-4253-ad0d-dafb962e567e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=98f4ccbff1e479b28d90d8989a7dba4c, https://si.imgix.net/9fc75fa7/uploads/origins/b259d2d8-1cdd-4253-ad0d-dafb962e567e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd12dedf79a338af7c5867ccd90fa442 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9fc75fa7/uploads/origins/b259d2d8-1cdd-4253-ad0d-dafb962e567e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89fb2db3448418e237810a123190fd3d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello.\n\nIf possible, I would like to request Oboro from Fire Emblem IF wearing the maid outfit from the same game. Pose and expression is up to you. Only thing I would like is the gemstone color is blueish, like the modification I did in the game. And that in the artwork her legs with the stockings appear.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1pi0QGmkjuMH_ySSF2I0C02LiXDB5D3mw/\n\nThank you for your time reading this request.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1b-LKq7gmVjpcpLf1v2agF_jMBFH0F73D", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/98817dd2/uploads/origins/b5e52980-1093-4aae-9546-96e6f298483e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0217f1e00612ab84bcc42629b8edecc3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/98817dd2/uploads/origins/b5e52980-1093-4aae-9546-96e6f298483e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0217f1e00612ab84bcc42629b8edecc3, https://si.imgix.net/98817dd2/uploads/origins/b5e52980-1093-4aae-9546-96e6f298483e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c45dc4fc912d153c9269b7dc11c62e5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/98817dd2/uploads/origins/b5e52980-1093-4aae-9546-96e6f298483e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d021b936c704fd2cb94a2c3903db589 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Your artwork is very beautiful. Can I request an illustration of my Vtuber Shinobishii and my friend's Melunah? Shinobishii is a ninja Vtuber. Melunah is a magical school girl based on the moon and the stars.\nCan you draw them together in a café eating fruit crêpes (クレープ) and cream puffs (シュークリーム)?\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cNVBoOmeRfw38okixlJ9GQd-45M31cE9", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5e9ddc28/uploads/origins/dd5625de-e12a-4ca1-af5d-afa4c8099ca1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20507bb94414d1f661b510e536675ddb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5e9ddc28/uploads/origins/dd5625de-e12a-4ca1-af5d-afa4c8099ca1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20507bb94414d1f661b510e536675ddb, https://si.imgix.net/5e9ddc28/uploads/origins/dd5625de-e12a-4ca1-af5d-afa4c8099ca1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26a20c2c6b12ff21341afa75d3d683ee 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5e9ddc28/uploads/origins/dd5625de-e12a-4ca1-af5d-afa4c8099ca1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b116266b949d27530cfe61f4fcf9f74 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Please draw Scabiosa from Fire Emblem Heroes.\nhttps://i.imgur.com/Hb1w5Y9.png\nDraw her \"Spring Forever\" alternate outfit from the game.\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/izumi-niche/OifeyImg/master/heroes/portrait/924.webp?raw\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/izumi-niche/OifeyImg/master/heroes/special/924.webp?raw\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/izumi-niche/OifeyImg/master/heroes/damage/924.webp?raw\n\nShe's cool, but also cute. Draw her wings, the vines in her hair, and her makeup. Her skin is very pale, and her ears are pointed, but her ears are usually not visible. She is cold and distant, please make it a cool image.\n\nhttps://fireemblem.fandom.com/wiki/Triandra/Gallery", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0c401957/uploads/origins/ade26f22-59a7-40cc-8c2c-ec883cd69edd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08d56de74e73ad5a837ff3ba732b97db", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0c401957/uploads/origins/ade26f22-59a7-40cc-8c2c-ec883cd69edd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08d56de74e73ad5a837ff3ba732b97db, https://si.imgix.net/0c401957/uploads/origins/ade26f22-59a7-40cc-8c2c-ec883cd69edd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=556487b0dedac98d997bdf34ffc698ff 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0c401957/uploads/origins/ade26f22-59a7-40cc-8c2c-ec883cd69edd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4b40a0f42a0a1b57864bb6380ed4070 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Greetings! I'd like to request a full-body illustration of Veronica from FEH playing the violin while she wears the outfit of \"Tenshi\" from AngelBeats. \nVeronica must have the hairstyle and body type of her most recent form: https://guide.fire-emblem-heroes.com/00001005000881-2/\n(Note: Don't add the wings, since those are part of that dress and not part of Veronica)\nReference for Tenshi's outfit: https://i.imgur.com/DDNqNPk.png\n\nVeronica is like Tenshi, in that she was initially an enemy and then befriends the protagonists. The illustration should a similar atmosphere to the one that the OP of AngelBeats has in the parts where Tenshi is on-screen: https://youtu.be/Turf7WDB3iY", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/177eb802/uploads/origins/d6bcab72-0d98-49b5-942d-746dd984aa46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d8cf6ad3dcb62c2025fbcac62141e0d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/177eb802/uploads/origins/d6bcab72-0d98-49b5-942d-746dd984aa46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d8cf6ad3dcb62c2025fbcac62141e0d, https://si.imgix.net/177eb802/uploads/origins/d6bcab72-0d98-49b5-942d-746dd984aa46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6bf0639b92e9640479c9f53f13f4d95c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/177eb802/uploads/origins/d6bcab72-0d98-49b5-942d-746dd984aa46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa1d6db608f678444995170ad7130240 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi there I would like for you to draw Céline from fire emblem engage. In the drive folder there is an outfit in the game that I have put her in I would like for you to draw her in that please.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1sccdjYKDSLtNYVPOkAhBK26U8egmUZW7", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/933653f7/uploads/origins/837df0a0-f476-4b05-a1ac-b3b75b48ac88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db62a3ba2c9e2e80db0762a6c155e183", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/933653f7/uploads/origins/837df0a0-f476-4b05-a1ac-b3b75b48ac88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db62a3ba2c9e2e80db0762a6c155e183, https://si.imgix.net/933653f7/uploads/origins/837df0a0-f476-4b05-a1ac-b3b75b48ac88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24a58d10963332bacbf54538359d1dae 2x, https://si.imgix.net/933653f7/uploads/origins/837df0a0-f476-4b05-a1ac-b3b75b48ac88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e918cf0f8cd1c67e156947272d24ef9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\n\nCould you draw Nino and Nanna from the Fire Emblem Heroes game?  \n\nThey are celebrating the Lunar New Year together.  They are both wearing the traditional Chinese qipaos (チャイナ服).  \n\nNanna is wearing her feather hair ornament, and Nino her hairband.  Please use any design, pose and background you prefer.  \n\nReference for Nino can be found at https://guide.fire-emblem-heroes.com/06029009000083/  \n\nReference for Nanna can be found at https://guide.fire-emblem-heroes.com/04001003000237/\n\nI plan to post this artwork on Reddit.  Please feel free to post it on Twitter, Pixiv and anywhere else you see fit.\n\nThanking you in advance!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/78418063/uploads/origins/acf0b0ca-ecc9-45a8-bf2e-1c9e0775ed19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=299310e895df2bb987e1e2bdf96d814c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/78418063/uploads/origins/acf0b0ca-ecc9-45a8-bf2e-1c9e0775ed19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=299310e895df2bb987e1e2bdf96d814c, https://si.imgix.net/78418063/uploads/origins/acf0b0ca-ecc9-45a8-bf2e-1c9e0775ed19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23b62a88375dc81f2558e45fd77dfb79 2x, https://si.imgix.net/78418063/uploads/origins/acf0b0ca-ecc9-45a8-bf2e-1c9e0775ed19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9594a8d32fa553e81bcd1bd51c54acc3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello,\n\nI would like you to draw Elise from Fire Emblem playing the violin. I would like to see her happy and relaxed.\n\nI would also like the background to be a night sky with a blue moon.\n\nhttps://feheroes.fandom.com/wiki/Elise:_Budding_Flower?file=Elise_Budding_Flower_Face.webp", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9cb393b5/uploads/origins/538acb9b-b8c0-478d-a6ef-7f2dc59aa05c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=762dc4be4dfeceb21f69f2a5e1f73aff", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9cb393b5/uploads/origins/538acb9b-b8c0-478d-a6ef-7f2dc59aa05c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=762dc4be4dfeceb21f69f2a5e1f73aff, https://si.imgix.net/9cb393b5/uploads/origins/538acb9b-b8c0-478d-a6ef-7f2dc59aa05c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2806b1ac6307175766cae3256ab154fd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9cb393b5/uploads/origins/538acb9b-b8c0-478d-a6ef-7f2dc59aa05c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aac73b8ae690efb885f4018252832f6b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I would like to make a request for the newly released summer Edelgard design from Fire Emblem. The official art can be shown here: https://twitter.com/kakage0904/status/1536907342326816768?s=20&t=y8IKQxQ1TKrBwF16SzpRTg\n\nEdelgard is the women with white hair on the left. I would like a beach background. You are free to decide on the pose and I'll leave the rest of the details to you.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/kakage0904/status/1536907342326816768?s=20&t=y8IKQxQ1TKrBwF16SzpRTg", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a4bf9225/uploads/origins/f52ae832-50f2-472b-a4f9-458d5db27c63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65bbf0f41f41366b31e92ce94dee2224", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a4bf9225/uploads/origins/f52ae832-50f2-472b-a4f9-458d5db27c63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65bbf0f41f41366b31e92ce94dee2224, https://si.imgix.net/a4bf9225/uploads/origins/f52ae832-50f2-472b-a4f9-458d5db27c63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=07c3410ee1a06250738672d83aed9f7e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a4bf9225/uploads/origins/f52ae832-50f2-472b-a4f9-458d5db27c63?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=15d99c0a710e528d8e5c5f1afbea2195 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I would like you to draw Lissa and \"Marth\" from Fire Emblem Awakening in your style. They can be drawn as half-bodies.\n\nLissa references: https://imgur.com/a/3v1BuTn\n\n\"Marth\" references: https://imgur.com/a/tZl9dFF\n\nLissa is kissing \"Marth\" on the cheek like this. https://safebooru.org/index.php?page=post&s=view&id=3877282\n\nLissa is smiling with her eyes closed and blushing. She is shorter than \"Marth\", just tall enough to reach his cheek.\n\n\"Marth\" is surprised and shocked at the kiss. (As much as you can convey it through the mask) He is gasping and blushing with his mouth open.\n\nThank you very much!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/38afbbc1/uploads/origins/0ac7b829-86a1-45dd-bef8-bfeb184aaaaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=948c87450fa680b72334b4b3b6078859", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/38afbbc1/uploads/origins/0ac7b829-86a1-45dd-bef8-bfeb184aaaaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=948c87450fa680b72334b4b3b6078859, https://si.imgix.net/38afbbc1/uploads/origins/0ac7b829-86a1-45dd-bef8-bfeb184aaaaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4802cbfe99794899027116d28890d75a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/38afbbc1/uploads/origins/0ac7b829-86a1-45dd-bef8-bfeb184aaaaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a338fc3f0c188135351f257ca8316a32 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again,\n\nThank you very much for your illustration from my previous request.  If it is ok if I can I put another request in? I was wondering if you could draw Kagero from Fire Emblem Fates. But draw her with her Cipher Art, \"kagero Garbed in Glory R +\" I'll put it in the references. You can choose the expression, background and pose. Thank you very much! \n\nKagero: \nhttps://static.wikia.nocookie.net/fireemblem/images/8/81/Saizo_R%2B_and_Kagero_R%2B_-_Mayo.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/455?cb=20161229083924\n\nhttps://static.wikia.nocookie.net/fireemblem/images/e/e0/B07-062R%2B.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SilkenTofu/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6bcf1d9f/uploads/origins/df12ac49-ebb0-4be6-8227-7cfd39f6b04e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e47ba15f53b7e691ddc60de585da50a1", "thumbnail_srcset